  "prefLabel": "He-W 575.03 Provider Participation",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-W 575.03 Provider Participation. All participating AAC providers shall:\n\n(a) Be an enrolled New Hampshire Medicaid durable medical equipment (DME) provider;\n\n(b) Request and obtain prior authorization from the department in accordance with He-W 575.06 below; and\n\n(c) Provide the recipient and caregiver with equipment training and related supports, including equipment set-up, training in the use and maintenance of the AAC aid, and technical support.\n\nSource. #10636, eff 7-12-14",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-w500.html"
